      "observed_dialogue": [
        {
          "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.85",
          "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
          "text": "Yes , so what I uh prefer maybe uh you need to interact uh more with the Christine , okay ,",
          "participant": "MIO086",
          "role": "PM"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.86",
          "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
          "text": "because you know what she is going to do it , okay ,",
          "participant": "MIO086",
          "role": "PM"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.87",
          "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
          "text": "and you know how to sell it . Okay ,",
          "participant": "MIO086",
          "role": "PM"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.88",
          "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
          "text": "because uh she is doing the design ,",
          "participant": "MIO086",
          "role": "PM"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.89",
          "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
          "text": "but you are the core because you are in the marketing , okay ,",
          "participant": "MIO086",
          "role": "PM"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "IS1008a.D.dialog-act.s9553330.43",
          "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
          "text": "Yeah .",
          "participant": "MIE085",
          "role": "ME"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.90",
          "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
          "text": "so because you need to sell <disfmarker> and you're the responsible for the all the money , the finance , okay , tomorrow .",
          "participant": "MIO086",
          "role": "PM"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "IS1008a.D.dialog-act.s9553330.44",
          "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
          "text": "Mm-hmm .",
          "participant": "MIE085",
          "role": "ME"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.91",
          "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
          "text": "So , what I prefer , okay , so you need to interact with the Christine more and uh within her team , okay , who is using the functional design or technical design , okay ,",
          "participant": "MIO086",
          "role": "PM"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "IS1008a.D.dialog-act.s9553330.45",
          "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
          "text": "Mm-hmm .",
          "participant": "MIE085",
          "role": "ME"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.92",
          "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
          "text": "and uh you need to come up with some kind of plan , okay , how we are going to do the <disfmarker> your sales plan , okay ,",
          "participant": "MIO086",
          "role": "PM"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "IS1008a.D.dialog-act.s9553330.46",
          "meeting_id": "IS1008a",
          "text": "Do we already have a cost limit on this , th an idea of how much uh we want to market this for , how much it's gonna sell for ,",
          "participant": "MIE085",
          "role": "ME"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "IS1008a.D.dialog-act.s9553330.42",
          "participant": "MIE085",
          "role": "ME",
          "text": "and then it's gotta be simple to use ."
        },
        {
          "da_id": "IS1008a.A.dialog-act.s9553330.93",
          "participant": "MIO086",
          "role": "PM",
          "text": "th"
        }
      ],
      "peer_items": [
        {
          "item_key": "IS1008a#0",
          "type": "actions",
          "text": "Ed will provide a written project plan by the next meeting, including functional and technical design, required team size, timeframe, budget, and marketing plan."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "IS1008a#1",
          "type": "actions",
          "text": "PM will send a copy of the slides to attendees after the meeting."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "IS1008a#2",
          "type": "actions",
          "text": "UI will start determining the functional design."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "IS1008a#3",
          "type": "actions",
          "text": "Industrial designer will identify which people from marketing, technical, and administration will contribute to the plan."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "IS1008a#4",
          "type": "actions",
          "text": "The UI will CC Ed on all discussions or documents that are passed around."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "IS1008a#5",
          "type": "actions",
          "text": "The UI will copy PM on all mails and discussions."
